sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Customer UI
  participant P1 as S01 and S02
  participant P2 as S03 and S04
  participant P3 as S05
  participant P4 as S06 and S07
  alt Required current prerequisites hold
    P0->>P1: 1 Admit people owners and workloads
    P0->>P2: 2 Enroll read-only source connection
    P2->>P1: 3 Propose discovered inventory links
    P0->>P1: 4 Link services agents and shared resources
    P0->>P3: 5 Propose or resolve imported objectives
    P3->>P3: 6 Independent review and activation
    P2->>P4: 7 Supply qualified source observations
    P1->>P4: 8 Accept and project typed dependencies
    P4->>P0: 9 Show actual setup and evaluation results
  else A prerequisite fails or an external outcome is uncertain
    Note over P0,P4: An unresolved import, missing owner, stale source or unavailable prerequisite remains visible. Screen visits do not complete setup.
  end
